msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Encrypted block devices require kernel support.  To use it, the appropriate "
"kernel configuration parameters need to be set:"
msgstr ""
"Dispositivos de bloco encriptados exigem suporte de núcleo. Para usá-lo, os "
"parâmetros apropriados de configuração do núcleo precisam estar "
"configurados:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of cryptsetup"
msgstr "Instalação do cryptsetup"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>cryptsetup</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale <application>cryptsetup</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:127
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --disable-ssh-token \\\n"
"            --disable-asciidoc  &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --disable-ssh-token \\\n"
"            --disable-asciidoc  &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:137
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<literal>CONFIG_SCSI_LOWLEVEL,\n"
"CONFIG_SCSI_DEBUG,\n"
"CONFIG_BLK_DEV_DM_BUILTIN,\n"
"CONFIG_CRC_T10DIF,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_USER,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_CRYPTD,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_LRW,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_XTS,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_ESSIV,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_TI,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_NI_INTEL,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_BLOWFISH,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_CAST5,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_SERPENT,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_SERPENT_SSE2_X86_64,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_SERPENT_AVX_X86_64,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_SERPENT_AVX2_X86_64, and\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_TWOFISH_X86_64</literal>"
msgstr ""
"<literal>CONFIG_SCSI_LOWLEVEL,\n"
"CONFIG_SCSI_DEBUG,\n"
"CONFIG_BLK_DEV_DM_BUILTIN,\n"
"CONFIG_CRC_T10DIF,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_USER,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_CRYPTD,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_LRW,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_XTS,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_ESSIV,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_TI,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_NI_INTEL,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_BLOWFISH,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_CAST5,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_SERPENT,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_SERPENT_SSE2_X86_64,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_SERPENT_AVX_X86_64,\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_SERPENT_AVX2_X86_64, and\n"
"CONFIG_CRYPTO_TWOFISH_X86_64</literal>"

#. I had 1 of 21 tests fail with the above crypto options in the
#.       kernel.  Eight tests were not run.  Version 2.4.3.
#.       Failed test  was tcrypt-compat-test
#.       tcrypt-images/tc_1-ripemd160-cbc-aes [FAILED]
#.       bdubbs
#.       Version 2.6.1 12/03/2023 -bdubbs
#.       2 of 26 tests failed (6 tests were not run)
#.       FAIL: keyring-compat-test
#.       FAIL: tcrypt-compat-test
#.       Version 2.7.0 01/25/2024 -bdubbs
#.       2 of 25 tests failed (8 tests were not run)
#.       FAIL: keyring-compat-test
#.       FAIL: tcrypt-compat-test
#.       Version 2.8.1 08/20/2025 -renodr
#.       =======================
#.       All 24 tests passed
#.       (10 tests were not run)
#.       =======================
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the result, issue as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user: <command>make check</command>.  "
"Some tests will fail if appropriate kernel configuration options are not "
"set. Some additional options that may be needed for tests are: <placeholder "
"type=\"screen\" id=\"0\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Para testar o resultado, emita como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>: <command>make check</command>. Alguns "
"testes falharão se opções apropriadas de configuração do núcleo não "
"estiverem configuradas. Algumas opções adicionais que possivelmente sejam "
"necessárias para testes são: <placeholder type=\"screen\" id=\"0\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:183
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:188
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:191
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-ssh-token</parameter>: This switch is required if the "
"optional libssh dependency is not installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-ssh-token</parameter>: Essa chave é exigida se a "
"dependência opcional libssh não estiver instalada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:196
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-asciidoc</parameter>: This switch disables regeneration"
" of the man pages. Remove this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"asciidoctor\" role=\"nodep\"/> installed and wish to regenerate "
"the man pages.  Note that even if this switch is used, the pre-generated man"
" pages are shipped in the tarball and they'll still be installed."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-asciidoc</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita regeneração"
" das páginas de manual. Remova essa chave se você tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"asciidoctor\" role=\"nodep\"/> instalado e desejar regenerar as "
"páginas de manual. Observe que mesmo se essa chave for usada, as páginas de "
"manual pré geradas são enviadas no tarball e ainda serão instaladas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:206
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring cryptsetup"
msgstr "Configurando cryptsetup"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/cryptsetup.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Because of the number of possible configurations, setup of encrypted volumes"
" is beyond the scope of the BLFS book. Please see the configuration guide in"
" the cryptsetup <ulink "
"url=\"https://gitlab.com/cryptsetup/cryptsetup/wikis/FrequentlyAskedQuestions#2-setup\">"
" FAQ</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"Devido ao número de configurações possíveis, a configuração de volumes "
"encriptados está além do escopo do livro BLFS. Por favor, veja-se o guia de "
"configuração nas <ulink "
"url=\"https://gitlab.com/cryptsetup/cryptsetup/wikis/FrequentlyAskedQuestions#2-setup\">"
" Perguntas Frequentes</ulink> do cryptsetup."

